# A conversation with an agent, run stepped by the fixture harness
# (`fixture-test`; docs/dev-practices/headless-mode.md, "A package's
# fixtures"): its service is agents-api's fake over the conversation script
# (`AgentsApiTest.FixtureSupport`), and its agent's child the process fake's,
# paused for ever (`AcpTest.FixtureSupport`), so no real adapter is started.
# It is stepped only: through the CLI it would start the user's real
# `claude-agent-acp`, so it has no entry in the real-thread set. What it
# prints must be exactly `expected`.
#
# The file opened is the working directory's marker, so its buffer is in
# the workspace `/work/lean`, where the session starts. The prompt's reply,
# the tool call folded, the usage, the title and the mode the session
# reports are shown; `/Edit` finds the tool call's row and `<Tab>` unfolds
# it to its final diff; a cancel with no turn in flight says so; and a stop
# ends the session.

reload
settle

key : Semicolon shift
commit e /work/lean/lakefile.lean
key <Enter> Enter -
settle

key : Semicolon shift
commit agent-start
key <Enter> Enter -
settle
scene

key : Semicolon shift
commit agent-prompt Read notes.txt.
key <Enter> Enter -
settle
advance 50
settle
scene

key / Slash -
commit Edit
key <Enter> Enter -
key <Tab> Tab -
settle
scene

key : Semicolon shift
commit agent-cancel
key <Enter> Enter -
settle
scene

key : Semicolon shift
commit agent-stop
key <Enter> Enter -
settle
scene
